  "pt": {
    "subject": "A decorrer agora na BidRoom: leilões a não perder",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-PT\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ececea;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#334155;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    Uma seleção de leilões abertos — joalharia, arte, colecionáveis e mais.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ececea;padding:32px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:26px 30px 22px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.4px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.18em;\">Leilões Premium</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;height:3px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111111;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">A decorrer agora</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;\">Selecionámos peças de categorias diferentes com licitação aberta. Explore e faça a sua proposta — licitar é gratuito e leva menos de um minuto.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;border-radius:999px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 32px;color:#111111;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Ver todos os leilões</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">Pagamentos seguros · Propostas em tempo real · Em Portugal</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);line-height:1.7;\">\n              <div style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;\">BidRoom</div>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">Recebeu este email porque é contacto ou cliente BidRoom.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">Gerir preferências / cancelar inscrição</a>\n                &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">www.bidroom.pt</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  "en": {
    "subject": "Live now on BidRoom: auctions worth a look",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ececea;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#334155;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    A selection of open auctions — jewellery, art, collectibles and more.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ececea;padding:32px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:26px 30px 22px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.4px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.18em;\">Premium Auctions</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;height:3px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111111;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Live right now</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;\">A handful of pieces from different categories, open for bidding. Take a look and make your offer — bidding is free and takes under a minute.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;border-radius:999px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 32px;color:#111111;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Browse all auctions</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">Secure payments · Real-time offers · Based in Portugal</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);line-height:1.7;\">\n              <div style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;\">BidRoom</div>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">You are receiving this email because you are a BidRoom contact or customer.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">Manage preferences / unsubscribe</a>\n                &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">www.bidroom.pt</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  "es": {
    "subject": "Ahora en BidRoom: subastas que no te puedes perder",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ececea;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#334155;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    Una selección de subastas abiertas — joyería, arte, coleccionables y más.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ececea;padding:32px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:26px 30px 22px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.4px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.18em;\">Subastas Premium</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;height:3px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111111;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">En directo ahora</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;\">Hemos seleccionado piezas de categorías diferentes con puja abierta. Échales un vistazo y haz tu oferta — pujar es gratis y lleva menos de un minuto.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;border-radius:999px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 32px;color:#111111;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Ver todas las subastas</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">Pagos seguros · Ofertas en tiempo real · En Portugal</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);line-height:1.7;\">\n              <div style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;\">BidRoom</div>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">Recibes este email porque eres contacto o cliente de BidRoom.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">Gestionar preferencias / cancelar suscripción</a>\n                &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">www.bidroom.pt</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  "fr": {
    "subject": "En direct sur BidRoom : des enchères à ne pas manquer",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ececea;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#334155;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    Une sélection d’enchères ouvertes — bijouterie, art, objets de collection et plus.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ececea;padding:32px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:26px 30px 22px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.4px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.18em;\">Enchères Premium</div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;height:3px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111111;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">En direct maintenant</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#334155;line-height:1.6;\">Une sélection de pièces de différentes catégories, ouvertes aux enchères. Découvrez-les et faites votre offre — enchérir est gratuit et prend moins d’une minute.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#C9A84C;border-radius:999px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 32px;color:#111111;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Voir toutes les enchères</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;\">Paiements sécurisés · Offres en temps réel · Au Portugal</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#111111;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(240,237,232,0.72);line-height:1.7;\">\n              <div style=\"color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;\">BidRoom</div>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">Vous recevez cet email car vous êtes contact ou client BidRoom.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">Gérer les préférences / se désabonner</a>\n                &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n                <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#C9A84C;text-decoration:underline;\">www.bidroom.pt</a>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  }
